130
00:05:42,547 --> 00:05:44,807
against their collections and users.

131
00:05:44,957 --> 00:05:47,012
That requires the distinctions developed

132
00:05:47,032 --> 00:05:49,434
through this course, rather than every

133
00:05:49,454 --> 00:05:52,269
